The operations request is not included. This node holds only `StateHandle<'seen', read>`, and the target has no WASI adapter, so it has no filesystem import for writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`. Adding `aap:caps/http-client` for the metadata fetch would give the node a capability its graph declaration doesn't grant, and it would send untrusted feed text to an outside host. Both changes should go through the graph definition: a logging or enrichment node, or an updated capability list for this one. The component below does only what the node declares.

